          "alternative": [
            "Rizel"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b173948-9YNQkeJn63cD.png"
        },
        "description": "He was an aristocrat who served as the prime minister of a large nation in a certain world, but one day he was suddenly transported to another world. After being transported to that world, he became an adventurer and decided to enjoy life in another world, calling it a \"vacation\". He has a very calm way of speaking and behaving, and is also endowed with an excellent mind.",
