        "name": {
          "full": "Gil",
          "native": "ジル",
          "alternative": [
            "The Blade (一刀)"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b361186-jdB5AwV4Cxqf.png"
        },
        "description": "Nicknamed \"The Blade,\" he is the strongest adventurer. He has a mean look in his eyes. He is skilled in human combat and monster subjugation. He also has a high ability to sense presence, making his abilities as an adventurer impeccable. Originally, he was a lone wolf who didn't flatter or obey anyone, but after meeting Lizel, he became his partner.",
        "gender": "Male",
