        },
        "description": "He is an employee of the Adventurer's Guild in the royal capital of Parteda. He rarely expresses emotions and generally remains expressionless at all times. Due to his emotionless appearance and the ice-element magic he uses, adventurers fear him and call him \"Absolute Zero.\" He is adept at anything from desk work to heavy lifting. He is an old friend of [Judge](https://anilist.co/character/380597/Judge).",
