        "description": "A tall man who runs a tool shop in the royal capital of Parteda. He has a timid personality and is reserved with everyone he interacts with. However, he can also make assertive statements at times. He has an excellent eye for appraisal, and sometimes helps appraise labyrinth items and monster materials brought to the Adventurer's Guild.",
