        },
        "description": "A middle-aged nobleman who manages the military police, he holds the title of Viscount. He is sociable and can talk to anyone casually, and does not often abuse his power. Furthermore, his refreshing appearance makes him very popular among the townspeople. He is also a \"labyrinth item collector,\" and acquires items of interest through the Adventurer's Guild and auctions.",
